  "notes": [
    "vs.SetTexMapRealN documents part 3 as the overall part. The recipe uses part 3 in vs.SetTextureRefN too. The texture reference is the vs.Name2Index value of Rosetta-Texture.",
    "Selector 3 sets the 2D scale to 2.5 and selector 4 sets the rotation to 30 degrees.",
    "resource.texture.default creates the texture and places no object. vs.CreateTexture gives a texture with no image, so the export material carries a colour only."
